WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:03.950
Hi, and welcome! I'm so glad you're here.

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:06.460
You asked about earning money from home.

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:09.610
Maybe, the bills are growing faster than
your paycheck.

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:13.650
Maybe, your retirement isn't stretching as
far as you hoped.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.390
Or maybe you just want more time at home,

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:19.470
and better health for you and the people you
love.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:23.080
Whatever brought you here, this page is
about you:

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:26.670
your goals, your questions, and your
concerns.

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:31.680
As you scroll down, you'll find honest
answers to the questions you're probably
asking.

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:36.050
Is this legitimate? What does it really
cost? What's the catch?

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.600
Will I have to pester my friends and family?

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:41.690
You'll also see why so many people feel safe
here:

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:46.090
a company that's debt free, with members in
more than sixty countries,

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:50.640
and all-natural, science-based products
people use for their own health.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.320
Think of it as a vehicle, one that can help
you work toward whatever matters most to
you.

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:59.850
For some people, that's a few hundred extra
dollars a month,

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:02.150
a little safety net for the family.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.920
For others, it grows into something bigger.

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:06.610
There are no guarantees.

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:09.600
What you earn depends on the work you're
willing to put in.

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:11.400
But you won't be doing it alone.

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:15.080
When you're ready, give Carl a call. He'll
listen first.

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:18.000
It's a conversation, not a sales pitch.

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:19.500
Thanks for watching!
